# A loop over a Set or a Map whose turns write no entry of any collection and run no other code steps the table on facts that are read once, in front
# of the loop: CollectionTableFacts gives how many entries the table has used, where its keys and its values lie and how wide they are, and each step
# takes them in place of reading the table, testing its kind and computing its columns at every turn. The table that comes round in a parameter of the
# head stays as it entered: no step reads it again. The loop is walked once as it is written, which shows what its turns do, and then on the facts.
# A loop whose turns store into a collection (grow: set.add writes CollectionEntries) or call what may do anything (tell) steps the table as it is written.
# REQUIRES: entries-of-bun
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+UnboxedNumbers+Guesses+Folding+LoopInvariants+DirectCalls+Arrivals+EscapeAnalysis
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK: = IsPristine {{*}}builtinClass=Set
# CHECK: [[facts]]: {{*}} = CollectionTableFacts [[set]]
# CHECK-NEXT: [[used]]: {{*}} = ResultAt [[facts]]
# CHECK-NEXT: [[keys]]: {{*}} = ResultAt [[facts]] index=1
# CHECK-NEXT: [[flags]]: {{*}} = ResultAt [[facts]] index=3
# CHECK-NEXT: [[start]]: {{*}} = ResultAt [[facts]] index=4
# CHECK: isInLoop=true isLoopHead=true
# CHECK: = SetNext [[set]], {{*}} used=[[used]] keys=[[keys]] flags=[[flags]]
# CHECK-NOT: = CollectionTable
# RUN(MAP): walk f2 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+UnboxedNumbers+Guesses+Folding+LoopInvariants+DirectCalls+Arrivals+EscapeAnalysis
# MAP-LABEL: code f2:Body
# MAP: [[facts]]: {{*}} = CollectionTableFacts [[map]]
# MAP: [[values]]: {{*}} = ResultAt [[facts]] index=2
# MAP: isInLoop=true isLoopHead=true
# MAP: = MapNext [[map]], {{*}} values=[[values]]
# MAP-NOT: = CollectionTable
# RUN(GROW): walk f3 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+UnboxedNumbers+Guesses+Folding+LoopInvariants+DirectCalls+Arrivals+EscapeAnalysis
# GROW-LABEL: code f3:Body
# GROW-NOT: CollectionTableFacts
# GROW: isInLoop=true isLoopHead=true
# GROW: = SetNext
# GROW-NOT: used=
# GROW: = CollectionTable
# RUN(TELL): walk f4 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+UnboxedNumbers+Guesses+Folding+LoopInvariants+DirectCalls+Arrivals+EscapeAnalysis
# TELL-LABEL: code f4:Body
# TELL-NOT: CollectionTableFacts
# TELL: isInLoop=true isLoopHead=true
# TELL: = SetNext
# TELL-NOT: used=
# TELL: = CollectionTable
# RUN(WITHHELD): walk f1 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+UnboxedNumbers+Guesses+Folding+DirectCalls+Arrivals+EscapeAnalysis
# WITHHELD-LABEL: code f1:Body
# WITHHELD-NOT: CollectionTableFacts
# WITHHELD: = SetNext
# WITHHELD-NOT: used=
# WITHHELD: = CollectionTable

